<%- include('../partials/head', { title }) %>
<div class="page-header">
  <h1>New API key</h1>
  <div class="actions">
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/admin/apps/<%= app.id %>">Back to <%= app.name %></a>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="card" aria-labelledby="key-title">
  <h2 class="card-title" id="key-title"><%= app.name %></h2>
  <p class="warning">Copy this key now. It is shown only once: Relay keeps <%= app.legacySigning ? 'only an encrypted copy for checking signatures' : 'only a hash of it' %>, and nobody can display it again. If it is lost, regenerate it.</p>
  <div class="key-reveal">
    <code class="mono" id="new-api-key"><%= newKey %></code>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-small" data-copy="#new-api-key">Copy key</button>
  </div>
  <p class="small muted">Prefix <span class="mono"><%= prefix %>…</span> identifies this key in the key list and the log.</p>

<% if (regenerated) { -%>
<% if (graceSeconds > 0) { -%>
  <p>The previous key keeps working until <strong><%= fmt.dateTime(graceUntil) %></strong> (<%= graceLabel %>). Put the new key into the site before then.</p>
<% } else { -%>
  <p>The previous key was revoked and no longer works. Put the new key into the site now.</p>
<% } -%>
<% } -%>

<% if (app.legacySigning) { -%>
  <p>Use it as the HMAC signing secret for <span class="mono"><%= endpoint %></span>: <span class="mono">X-Relay-Signature: sha256=hex(HMAC-SHA256(key, timestamp + "." + raw body))</span>. It cannot be used with /v1/send.</p>
<% } else { -%>
  <p>Send it as <span class="mono">Authorization: Bearer &lt;key&gt;</span> to <span class="mono"><%= endpoint %></span>.</p>
<% } -%>
  <p class="help">Store it like a password: in the site's configuration or an environment variable, not in version control. Code snippets are on the app page.</p>
  <div class="actions">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/admin/apps/<%= app.id %>">Done</a>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
